==Overview==
The Rabid Rabbit Toilet is the new boss [[toilet]] for the Easter event. It can stun [[units]] by using its powers. When it stuns a unit, instead of the normal "💤" emoji appearing, text stating "''💀 2 min💀''", which stuns units for 120 seconds (2 minutes) and is the only toilet to do this. 

This is the new strongest event enemy (1.2M base health), dethroning the [[Mutant Pumpkin Toilet]] (1M base health). The strongest toilet in the game is the [[The Mothership]]. 

==Waves==

=== [[Egg Island|Easter Mode]] ===

* Wave 60

== Health ==
[[Easter Event 2024|Easter Mode]]

Wave 60: 11,820,000

=== Others: ===
Wave 1: 1,200,000

== Strategy ==
Spawns on Wave 60 on [[Egg Island]], you must use an unstunning unit (like [[Speaker Repair Drone]]) or an unstunnable [[Units|Unit]] (like [[Leprechaun Cameraman]]). Use high DPS [[Units]] to defeat him. use [[Shield Cameraman]] for the boss to try to stun your problems are gone. Use units that can block a decent amount of stuns with high DPS, such as [[Sword Large Cameraman]] or [[Saber Mutant Toilet]].

== Trivia ==

* This enemy has the second longest stunning, beaten by [[The Grim Reaper]] who has infinite stun duration
* An alternative of [[Shield Cameraman]] is [[Upgraded Large Laser Cameraman]]. However, he only gets his shield at max level, so use [[Shield Cameraman]] for this.
* It's confirmed that its stun cannot be healed.

